--   any 314.50(j) exclusivity claim. It is conditional.
--   ind_safety_report:fda fda-ind-safety-report-v1.2 (7 nodes), superseding
--   fda-ind-safety-report-v1.1: The 312.32(c)(1) similar-reports part moves to
--   the end, where its code (7) sorts. A reader that orders sections by code
--   had already put it there.
--   orphan:fda fda-orphan-request-v1.2 (8 nodes), superseding
--   fda-orphan-request-v1.1: The 316.20(b)(5) clinical-superiority part is now
--   coded 3.1, beside the scientific rationale. The 316.20(b)(6) orphan-subset
--   part is now 4.1, beside the prevalence. Both were 7 and 8, which sorted
--   after the literature references.
--   designation:fda fda-btd-request-v1.2 (6 nodes), superseding
--   fda-btd-request-v1.1: The substantial-improvement criterion is now coded
--   5.1, under the preliminary clinical evidence it is shown from, so code
--   order is document order. It was 7, which sorted after the development plan.
--   rmat:fda fda-rmat-request-v1.1 (7 nodes), superseding
--   fda-rmat-request-v1.0: Regenerative medicine therapy eligibility is now
--   coded 2.1, under the product it describes; it was 8, which sorted last.
--   Unmet medical need now comes before the evidence for it.
--   icf:ich c2c-icf-v1.2 (12 nodes), superseding c2c-icf-v1.1: The 50.25(c) and
--   50.25(b) parts (11, 12) move after the signatures (10), where their codes
--   sort. A reader that orders sections by code had already put them there.
--
-- THE LIMIT
--   A document already bound to a superseded version keeps that outline: the
--   composite FK to (doc_type, agency, version) is what makes the record true.
--   New projects get these versions (the scaffolder reads superseded_by IS NULL).
--   No pack here is reviewed by a regulatory professional; each states its basis.
--
-- RULE 1 (every file in C2C_MIGRATION_FILES re-runs on every deploy)
--   ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING; provenance is assigned after 20260810c re-runs;
--   supersede is guarded on the exact prior version and superseded_by IS NULL;
--   no constraint is touched: every doc_type here is already admitted;
--   the assertions at the end refuse a missing, truncated or edited row, and a
--   (doc_type, agency) without exactly one live pack, while tolerating a later
--   version superseding one of these.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

